graph TB
    subgraph Actors[" "]
        Guest((비회원))
        User((회원))
        Admin((관리자))
        AI((AI 시스템<br/>Gemini))
        PublicAPI((공공데이터 API))
    end

    subgraph System[EnjoyTrip 시스템]
        UC1[챗봇으로 추천 받기]
        UC2[직접 코스 설계]
        UC3[동선 최적화]
        UC4[회원가입/로그인]
        UC5[여행계획 저장]
        UC6[여행계획 조회/수정/삭제]
        UC7[코스 공유 - URL/QR]
        UC8[Customer Voice 작성]
        UC9[Customer Voice 답변]
        UC10[회원 관리]
    end

    Guest --> UC1
    Guest --> UC2
    Guest --> UC3
    Guest --> UC7
    Guest --> UC4

    User --> UC1
    User --> UC2
    User --> UC3
    User --> UC5
    User --> UC6
    User --> UC7
    User --> UC8

    Admin --> UC9
    Admin --> UC10

    UC1 -.uses.-> AI
    UC1 -.uses.-> PublicAPI
    UC2 -.uses.-> PublicAPI

    style Guest fill:#F1EFE8
    style User fill:#E6F1FB
    style Admin fill:#FBEAF0
    style AI fill:#EEEDFE
    style PublicAPI fill:#E1F5EE